<span id="32px_General"></span>
<div class="mw-translate-fuzzy">
== 일반 ==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* FreeCAD has adopted a new release schedule of three stable releases per year and switched to a CalVer versioning scheme (YY.N), starting with version 26.3. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD-Enhancement-Proposals/blob/master/FEPs/FEP-0003-release-schedule/README.md FEP-0003]
* Multiple documents can now be edited simultaneously with independent tasks and undo/redo stacks, for example, having two Sketches open at the same time (GSoC project). [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/21978 Pull request #21978]
* {{FileName|.FCBak}} backup files can now be opened directly from the File → Open dialog without renaming them to {{FileName|.FCStd}} first. Saving such a file triggers [[Std_SaveAs|Save As…]] to prevent accidentally overwriting the backup. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28454 Pull request #28454]
* The {{FileName|.FCBak}} backup date format preference now validates invalid filename characters and replaces invalid timestamp characters when creating backups. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/25985 Pull request #25985]
* The "Using undo/redo in documents" [[Preferences_Editor#Document|preference]] was removed as redundant. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30616 Pull request #30616]
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
== [[Image:Freecad.svg|32px]] User interface ==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{| cellpadding=5
| [[File:Navigation_cube_improvement_relnotes_26.3.png|384px]]
| The [[Navigation_Cube|Navigation Cube]] was improved, mostly in terms of appearance and functioning of its extra buttons. A home button was added.
[https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29338 Pull request #29338]
|}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
=== Further user interface improvements ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* The built-in text editor now supports line selection via clicking on the line number (and optionally also holding {{KEY|Shift}} for range selection). [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/27677 Pull request #27677]
* In the built-in text editor, the search field is now prefilled with the currently selected text. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/27674 Pull request #27674]
* Documents whose files are not writable now show read-only overlays in the [[Tree_View|Tree View]], with tooltips explaining that changes cannot be saved directly. Links to read-only documents now use a red read-only link overlay. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/26702 Pull request #26702]
* Customization of keyboard shortcuts was moved to the [[Preferences_Editor#Keyboard|Preferences Editor]]. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/27725 Pull request #27725]
* Clicking the expand/collapse indicator in the [[Tree_View|Tree View]] no longer accidentally changes the current selection range. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29687 Pull request #29687]
* Double-clicking a face of the [[Navigation_Cube|Navigation Cube]] will now rotate to it, but also center the view. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28608 Pull request #28608]
* The ''Recompute Object'' [[Tree_View|Tree View]] context menu option ([[Std_Refresh|Recompute]] command) now has a keyboard shortcut {{KEY|Ctrl}}+{{KEY|Shift}}+{{KEY|R}}. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/27880 Pull request #27880]
* There is now a [[Image:Std_ToggleBottomPanels.svg|16px]] [[Std_ToggleBottomPanels|Toggle Bottom Panels]] button and a shortcut {{KEY|Ctrl}} + {{KEY|0}} to toggle the bottom panels ([[Report_View|Report View]] and [[Python_Console|Python Console]]). [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28598 Pull request #28598]
* The [[Image:Std_AlignToSelection.svg|24px]] [[Std_AlignToSelection|Align to Selection]] command now supports multi-selection. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29182 Pull request #29182]
* The 3D View now supports drag box selection in common navigation styles, with left-to-right window selection and right-to-left crossing selection. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29547 Pull request #29547]
* Double-clicking on an expression field now clears the expression and keeps the current value. If no change is made, the expression is restored after losing focus. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29414 Pull request #29414]
* SpaceMouse rotations now honor the active navigation rotation center mode, including ''Object center'' and ''Drag at cursor'' modes. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29998 Pull request #29998]
* On macOS release builds, 3Dconnexion SpaceMouse devices now initialize correctly instead of reporting that the Navigation Framework is running outside an application bundle. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29465 Pull request #29465]
* The [[Std_VarSet|VarSet]] ''Rename Property Group'' dialog now offers autocompletion for existing property groups, making it easier to move variables between groups. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30200 Pull request #30200]
* There is now a warning when saving files created in older versions. A preference was added to allow disabling it. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28389 Pull request #28389]
* Clearing the recent files list now asks for confirmation before the list is removed. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/27274 Pull request #27274]
* All [[Status_Bar|Status Bar]] widgets can now be toggled through the context menu. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30349 Pull request #30349]
* The built-in text editor received several improvements for search feedback. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29423 Pull request #29423]
* It is now possible to suppress multiple objects at once. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30438 Pull request #30438]
* An icon and shortcut were added for the ''Clear'' option in the context menu of the [[Python_Console|Python Console]]. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30551 Pull request #30551]
* It is now possible to rotate the view by dragging the [[Navigation_Cube|Navigation Cube]]. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30727 Pull request #30727]
* The [[Std_VarSet|VarSet]] properties of the ''Percent'' type are now displayed with the percent suffix in the editor. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28730 Pull request #28730]
* Selection and preselection colors were improved for better visibility and distinguishability. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31050 Pull request #31050]
* An option to delete group contents for multiple objects at once was added. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30586 Pull request #30586]
* It is now possible to add custom toolbars with groups of Open, Save, and Help commands. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31525 Pull request #31525]
* The ViewProvider actions were added to the [[3D_View|3D View]] context menu. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30990 Pull request #30990]
</div>

