* Draft angular dimensions now create extension lines. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/27987 Pull request #27987]
* [[Draft_PolarArray|Polar Array]] and [[Draft_CircularArray|Circular Array]] are now aware of the active working plane. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/28324 Pull request #28324]
* SVG import can now approximate suitable curves to arcs and lines. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29142 Pull request #29142]
* SVG import now supports UTF-16 encoded files, such as SVG files generated by some Windows applications. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29244 Pull request #29244]
* Draft angular dimensions now honor overshoot settings. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29298 Pull request #29298]
* Draft [[Draft_Workbench#Annotation|Annotation]] and [[Draft_Workbench#Modification|Modification]] tools now use input hints. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/29649 Pull request #29649], [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30436 Pull request #30436] and [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30437 Pull request #30437]
* A [[Draft_Hatch|Draft Hatch]] can now be applied to multiple objects and/or individual faces belonging to one or more objects. [https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/30578 Pull request #30578]
